                   Jimmy user Doc."
                    Jimmy is a special program designed as an interactive"
      text  adventure.  You have many things to do in the game and"
     there arE many levels or rooms.   You will have to type a number"
      or a letter to choose what you want Jimmy to do.  Caps lock MUST  "
     be pressed throug the WHOLE game."
                    Hints "
        In this game there are many things you have to do to get the"
      right thing to happen for instance you may have to talk to BOB more"
     than once.   Here are a couple of hints"
    1> Always read everything carefully"
    2> when you buy your weapons make sure you sell the one you have"
    3> the secret code for the underground door rymes with DOOR"
    4> when you get back to the castle don't go right again or you will start over   "

        Thank YOU for taking the time to read this and look for"
                   JIMMY 2 the FINAL VOYAGE"

